3	// Server actions for the native webmail "Mailbox settings" panel
4	// (components/customer/mail/MailSettings.tsx, opened from the FolderRail).
5	//
6	// Every action authenticates the caller and resolves ONLY a mailbox they own via
7	// `resolveMailbox` (which also performs the ownership check used everywhere else
8	// in the mail client). Writes are rate-limited and return a friendly
9	// `{ ok, error }`. Alias operations additionally verify the target domain is one
10	// the caller actually owns (an EmailSubscription) before touching Mailcow.
