90	        <h2 className="text-lg font-semibold text-white">How Business Email works</h2>
91	      </div>
92	      <p className="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
93	        Add email hosting to any domain — one registered with Nxeon, or one you own elsewhere. If the
94	        domain is in your account we configure DNS for you and mail is enabled straight away. For a
95	        domain registered elsewhere, add the DNS records we show on the subscription below and hit
96	        <span className="font-medium text-slate-200"> Verify DNS</span> — mail starts flowing once
97	        verification succeeds.
98	      </p>
99	      <div className="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
100	        <Link href="/dashboard/mail" className="btn-primary py-1 text-sm">
101	          Open inbox →
102	        </Link>
103	        <Link href="/dashboard/domains" className="btn-secondary py-1 text-sm">
104	          Manage domain DNS →
105	        </Link>
106	        <span className="text-xs text-slate-500">
